  <conditions attached="1">
   <condition type="2">
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">Except the Association shall otherwise agree, not later than one month after the Effective Date, the Recipient, through MoF, shallcause KCGF to hire: (i) an environmental and social specialist; and (ii) a procurement specialist; all with terms of reference andqualifications acceptable to the Association.</narrative>
